/* Croatian stemmer for Snowball.
 *
 * Based on the rule tables of the "Simple stemmer for Croatian v0.2",
 * Copyright 2012 Nikola Ljubešić and Ivan Pandžić,
 * http://nlp.ffzg.hr/resources/tools/stemmer-for-croatian/
 * (originally LGPLv3; included here with the permission of Nikola Ljubešić to
 * publish it under a more permissive licence), and on the algorithm described in
 *   Nikola Ljubešić, Damir Boras, Ozren Kubelka (2007), "Retrieving Information
 *   in Croatian: Building a Simple and Efficient Rule-Based Stemmer".
 * The rules below are generated from those tables by a script, one routine per
 * rule line.
 *
 * Words containing a c-caron, c-acute, s-caron, z-caron or d-stroke use the diacritic rule set;
 * all other words use the same rules with those letters folded to c c s z d, so the stemmer also
 * works behind engines that strip diacritics before stemming.
 */

